OL,3,AVance tells Republicans to 'stop
OL,4,Awhining' about controversial Ohio
OL,5,Aattack ad
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS Vice-President JD Vance has urged
OL,8,Ffellow Republicans to stop "whining"
OL,9,Fabout a controversial attack ad that
OL,10,Ffeatured a Democratic candidate's
OL,11,Festranged mother calling her a liar.
OL,13,FWhile campaigning in Ohio for Vivek
OL,14,FRamaswamy, the Republican candidate for
OL,15,Fgovernor, Vance said he was "a little
OL,16,Fbit disgusted" by criticism from
OL,17,Fmembers of his own party.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
