OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AVance tells Republicans to 'stop
OL,4,Awhining' about controversial Ohio
OL,5,Aattack ad
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the ad, Donna Arthur, the mother of
OL,8,FDemocratic candidate Amy Acton, said
OL,9,Fher daughter "lied her entire life". It
OL,10,Fdoes not mention that Arthur's husband
OL,11,Fwas charged with raping Acton when she
OL,12,Fwas a child.
OL,14,FThe Ramaswamy campaign have claimed
OL,15,Fcredit for the ad, and have paid
OL,16,Fmillions to have it advertised around
OL,17,Fthe state.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
